{"parentUuid":"d45127ed-f8b9-47ab-9724-1395684a2828","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a79ee7002e52725ea","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CeZM1ZUU4GGTj93uFjFcT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QDfugv4ycmPRM1o7ptec78","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nfrom build.quadrature import hopf_rule, production_rule\nimport numpy as np\n\n# Check node count\nX, W = hopf_rule(12)  # D=12\nK = 13\nnu = 7\nprint(f'hopf_rule(12): {len(W)} nodes (expected {nu*K*K} = {nu*K*K})')\nprint(f'Weight sum: {W.sum():.15f}')\n\n# Check that nodes are on S^3\nnorms = np.sqrt((X**2).sum(axis=1))\nprint(f'Node norms: [{norms.min():.15f}, {norms.max():.15f}]')\n\"\n","description":"Run the user's exact test","timeout":30000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":840,"cache_read_input_tokens":48544,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":840,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeZM1Xzfn9jX8TZozYWdm","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"55241f96-8826-4ef0-a75e-29012b83ee42","timestamp":"2026-08-30T17:42:28.510Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/blake/Desktop/MIT/OpenWave/M8.5C2_BUILD","sessionId":"df404d7f-30da-41ec-8c3e-12ef3f92c53b","version":"2.1.251","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-orbiting-pelican"}
{"parentUuid":"55241f96-8826-4ef0-a75e-29012b83ee42","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"e22f4082-815d-4291-8ec0-471a24337109","agentId":"a79ee7002e52725ea","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QDfugv4ycmPRM1o7ptec78","type":"tool_result","content":"hopf_rule(12): 1183 nodes (expected 1183 = 1183)\nWeight sum: 1.000000000000000\nNode norms: [1.000000000000000, 1.000000000000000]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"79c628b7-6114-423a-a9df-111eaae80b34","timestamp":"2026-08-30T17:42:30.913Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"hopf_rule(12): 1183 nodes (expected 1183 = 1183)\nWeight sum: 1.000000000000000\nNode norms: [1.000000000000000, 1.000000000000000]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"55241f96-8826-4ef0-a75e-29012b83ee42","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/blake/Desktop/MIT/OpenWave/M8.5C2_BUILD","sessionId":"df404d7f-30da-41ec-8c3e-12ef3f92c53b","version":"2.1.251","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-orbiting-pelican"}
{"parentUuid":"79c628b7-6114-423a-a9df-111eaae80b34","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a79ee7002e52725ea","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CeZM2G1Ww3qBTiYyXjVXE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tests pass. Here is a summary of what was built.\n\n---\n\n**File created:** `/Users/blake/Desktop/MIT/OpenWave/M8.5C2_BUILD/build/quadrature.py`\n\n**Functions implemented:**\n\n1. **`hopf_rule(D)`** -- Hopf-coordinate product rule exact for polynomials of degree <= D on S^3. Uses K=D+1 uniform points in each of xi1, xi2, and nu=D//2+1 Gauss-Legendre points in u=sin^2(eta). Weights normalized to unit total measure. Node count = nu * K^2.\n\n2. **`production_rule(N)`** -- 4N-exact rule via `hopf_rule(4*N)`. Node count = (2N+1)(4N+1)^2.\n\n3. **`monitor_rule(N)`** -- 6N-exact rule via `hopf_rule(6*N)`. Node count = (3N+1)(6N+1)^2.\n\n4. **`eval_pi_n_unitary_at_nodes(n, nodes)`** -- Evaluates unitarized pi_n at all nodes. Returns shape (N_nodes, n+1, n+1).\n\n5. **`eval_section_at_nodes(intertwiner, n, nodes, pi_cache=None)`** -- Evaluates one intertwiner's section basis functions at nodes. Returns shape (N_nodes, d_rho, n+1). Accepts optional precomputed pi_n values.\n\n6. **`synthesis(coefficients, basis_obj, nodes, rho=None)`** -- Direct (non-FFT) transform: Galerkin coefficients to field values at nodes. Returns shape (N_nodes, d_rho).\n\n7. **`analysis(field_values, basis_obj, nodes, weights)`** -- Adjoint transform: field values at nodes to Galerkin coefficients. Returns shape (N_total,).\n\n**Key design note on normalization:** The Lowdin-orthonormalized intertwiners from `sections.build_basis_object` satisfy `tr(A_i^H A_k) / (n+1) = delta_{ik}`. Combined with Schur orthogonality (`integral pi[b,j]* pi[c,l] = delta_{bc} delta_{jl} / (n+1)`), the section basis functions are orthonormal, so the analysis inner product needs no extra normalization factor.\n\n**Test results:**\n- Node counts match expected formulas exactly\n- Weights sum to 1.0 (machine precision)\n- All nodes lie exactly on S^3\n- Schur orthogonality verified to ~1e-15 for levels 0-4\n- Synthesis/analysis round-trip verified to ~1e-14 relative error across all 9 sectors (R0 through R8), including the multi-level case (R8 at N=11 with 36 modes across 4 active levels)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":49384,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":389,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeZM2DoouYVWNcBrKqFWG","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"9504804f-c9b4-4666-8f6f-bf912064c52e","timestamp":"2026-08-30T17:42:51.016Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/blake/Desktop/MIT/OpenWave/M8.5C2_BUILD","sessionId":"df404d7f-30da-41ec-8c3e-12ef3f92c53b","version":"2.1.251","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-orbiting-pelican"}
